      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Monitored pings to my router to check for a correlation and there is indeed one that shows while using SteamLink. The red bars coincide with the timing of my Connection Interrupted errors. This is not an issue while using Virtual Desktop surprisingly. Given this evidence, it's possible this issue could be mitigated with QoL configured to limit the bandwidth used by SteamLink. Alternatively turning down the quality of the SteamLink stream to the headset might also alleviate this issue.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
