      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Can VRC please look into SteamLink & VRC it's still unusable even after changing OS?\n\nI even tried Bazzite and SteamLink still doesn't work.\n\nI also switched routers again and that didn't work.\n\nI've been through 3 different routers.\n\nSteamLink seems 100% unusable with VRChat\n\nAnyone here also experiencing this issue? And if so do you use an AMD processor?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
