      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "MAJOR UPDATE!\n\nI was told to change the \"Overlay Render Quality\" setting in SteamVR and this fixed my issue, I no longer get disconnected or any any memory leaking problems over long sessions.\n\nGo to SteamVR Menu > VR Settings > Video > Overlay Render Quality > Set it to LOW\n\nThis fixed my entire setup I no longer get disconnected when using Steam Link.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
