  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "1. Use a Quest headset (tested with 2 and Pro)\n\n2. Setup SteamLink on the HMD.\n\n3. Install Steam, disable all firewalls, and uninstall all virus scanners on the PC.\n\n4. Setup router with OpenNAT, disabled firewall, and forward all ports. (Isolated network to specific PC and HMD during this process.)\n\n5. Utilize SteamLink to play VRChat.\n\n6. Witness anywhere from 10 seconds to 5 minutes of repeated \"Your connection was interrupted\" errors and immediately rejoin the instance without any other issue. Zero issues with other streaming apps and games.\n\n7. Setup Virtual Desktop on headset and PC\n\n8. Utilize Virtual Desktop and recognize the connection issue is gone.\n\n9. Search the VRChat Discord for Connection Interrupted and discover a long term association with this issue and SteamLink.",
